./docs/plans/2026-04-06-memo-mentions/design.md:11:`Comments, mentions & reactions - Notion Help Center` shows the most common editor-side behavior: typing `@` triggers real-time search, mentions can live inline in page bodies and comments, clicking an inbox item takes the user back to the exact context, and no notification is sent when the target cannot access the page. `Notification settings - Notion Help Center` also separates in-product inbox behavior from secondary delivery like desktop or email.
